{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 CleanMyMac by MacPaw 為你呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，用 CleanMyMac 先清理空間、優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 第一日就發揮 100% 效能。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 係比 macOS 26 Tahoe 重大嘅升級，唔單止因為設計上更加明智。同 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 一樣，Mac 新增咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿，可以大幅改變成個系統嘅視覺效果。</p>\n<h2>呢條滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用嘅設計語言。初推出時 Liquid Glass 只有單一外觀，Apple 後來新增咗設定俾用戶將 Liquid Glass 調得冇咁透明。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 唔再局限於兩種風格。Apple 引入咗外觀滑桿，可以將 Liquid Glass 調得比以前更通透，亦可以設定為更不透明但依然現代感十足嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設為中等設定，系統亦會喺首次設定時邀請你調整滑桿。之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」入面隨時調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會實時預覽每個設定嘅效果。三個刻度分別代表最通透、中等、同最不透明，但你亦可以將滑桿調到刻度之間嘅任何位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock</h2>\n<p>Dock 係受 Liquid Glass 滑桿影響最明顯嘅元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢可以由清晰顯示你嘅桌面背景圖片，到變成更不透明、更具質感嘅物料。</p>\n<p>近距離睇吓：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>Widget</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面 widget 可以係全彩色、暗色，或者自動切換。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色 widget 嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcast</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcast 等有系統「播放中」工具列嘅應用程式，喺唔同 Liquid Glass 滑桿位置下會有截然唔同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以下係 Podcast 嘅「播放中」工具列：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而 Music 就係咁：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會影響側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕，改變「相片」、Safari 同其他有視窗介面嘅應用程式嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 嘅 Liquid Glass 滑桿有一個特點，就係單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅 Liquid Glass 外觀，即係話 Dock、widget 同視窗介面都會採用同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊一種？更通透、更不透明，定係中間？個人嚟講，我好喜歡我部 Mac 採用更不透明嗰個選項嗰種成熟美觀嘅感覺。當然，試吓更通透嘅效果都好有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 俾大家自行揀嘅權利。</p>\n<p>歡迎喺留言區分享你嘅睇法！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T22:19:05.670176+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1197,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}